version: 1.4.7
url: "https://github.com/bjreisman/chatgpt-endnote-mcp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bjreisman/chatgpt-endnote-mcp"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - endnote
  - mcp
  - codex
  - reference management
  - citation
  - academic research
  - literature review
  - pdf search
  - semantic search
  - embeddings
  - bibliography
  - bibtex
abstract: >-
  A local MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that connects one EndNote reference
  library to Codex desktop over stdio. Enables researchers to search references, read
  PDFs, format citations, export BibTeX, find related papers, and generate
  bibliographies directly within Codex conversations. Supports full-text
  search across PDF content, BM25-ranked metadata search, optional local
  semantic search using sentence-transformers embeddings, BibTeX export,
  and citation styles (APA 7th,
  Harvard, Vancouver, Chicago, IEEE).
